LaunchPilot & SaaS Pass: OpenSpec Phased Execution Roadmap
Optimized for Google AI Studio (Architectural Spec Engine) and OpenHands (Autonomous Execution Agent).
Executive Overview & Tooling Strategy
This roadmap details the phased execution model for building LaunchPilot and SaaS Pass. The system leverages an OpenSpec-driven methodology to maintain strict software boundaries, high-velocity autonomous code generation, and robust edge-first infrastructure.
Target Architecture
* Platform: Cloudflare Workers (Serverless Edge Runtime)
* Storage & Data: Cloudflare D1 (Serverless SQL), KV Cache, Vectorize
* Design Pattern: Domain-Driven Design (DDD) structured as vertical slices
