Technical Stack & Architectural Guardrails
* Edge Isolation: No Node.js runtime dependencies inside Worker handlers; strict adherence to Web Standard APIs (Fetch, Streams, Crypto).
* Contract-Driven Development: Schema changes must originate in openspec/ prior to code modifications.
* Database Access: Direct binding to Cloudflare D1 via parameterized SQL prepared statements; migrations managed explicitly via Wrangler.


